<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>KejaHub — Student Housing in Kenya</title>
  <link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Serif+Display&family=Inter:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
  <style>
    *, *::before, *::after { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    :root {
      --forest:   #1B4332;
      --moss:     #2D6A4F;
      --leaf:     #52B788;
      --earth:    #C97D3A;
      --earth-dk: #A86228;
      --ink:      #1A1A1A;
      --slate:    #3D4F47;
      --quiet:    #7A9088;
      --border:   #D4E6DB;
      --mist:     #EEF5F0;
      --cream:    #FFFDF5;
      --font-d:   'DM Serif Display', Georgia, serif;
      --font-b:   'Inter', system-ui, sans-serif;
    }
    body { font-family: var(--font-b); color: var(--slate); min-height: 100vh; }

    /* ── Navbar ── */
    .navbar {
      position: fixed; top: 0; left: 0; width: 100%; z-index: 100;
      display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;
      padding: 0 48px; height: 60px;
      background: var(--forest);
    }
    .navbar-logo { font-size: 20px; font-weight: 700; color: white; text-decoration: none; }
    .navbar-logo span { color: var(--earth); }
    .navbar-links { display: flex; gap: 4px; align-items: center; }
    .navbar-links a {
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); text-decoration: none; font-size: 14px;
      font-weight: 500; padding: 8px 16px; border-radius: 7px; transition: all .15s;
    }
    .navbar-links a:hover { background: rgba(255,255,255,0.12); color: white; }
    .navbar-links a.cta { background: var(--earth); color: white; font-weight: 600; }
    .navbar-links a.cta:hover { background: var(--earth-dk); }

    /* ── Hero — two-panel layout ── */
    .hero {
      min-height: 100vh;
      display: grid;
      grid-template-columns: 56fr 44fr;
    }

    /* Left: forest green with dot-grid texture (the signature element) */
    .hero-left {
      background-color: var(--forest);
      background-image: radial-gradient(circle, rgba(82,183,136,0.18) 1px, transparent 1px);
      background-size: 22px 22px;
      display: flex;
      flex-direction: column;
      justify-content: center;
      padding: 120px 52px 80px;
    }

    .hero-eyebrow {
      font-size: 11px;
      font-weight: 600;
      color: var(--leaf);
      text-transform: uppercase;
      letter-spacing: 1.8px;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }

    .hero-headline {
      font-family: var(--font-d);
      font-size: 56px;
      font-weight: 400;
      color: white;
      line-height: 1.08;
      margin-bottom: 20px;
    }
    .hero-headline em { font-style: italic; color: var(--leaf); }

    .hero-sub {
      font-size: 16px;
      color: rgba(255,255,255,0.68);
      line-height: 1.72;
      margin-bottom: 36px;
      max-width: 400px;
    }

    /* Quick search card */
    .hero-search {
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08);
      border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.14);
      border-radius: 14px;
      padding: 22px;
      max-width: 460px;
    }
    .hero-search h3 { color: white; font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600; margin-bottom: 12px; }
    .hs-row { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; gap: 8px; margin-bottom: 8px; }

    .hero-search input,
    .hero-search select {
      width: 100%; padding: 9px 13px;
      border: 1.5px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.18);
      border-radius: 7px; font-size: 13px;
      background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);
      color: white; font-family: var(--font-b);
      transition: border-color .2s;
    }
    .hero-search input::placeholder { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.42); }
    .hero-search input:focus,
    .hero-search select:focus { outline: none; border-color: var(--leaf); }
    .hero-search select option { color: var(--ink); background: white; }

    .search-submit {
      width: 100%; padding: 11px;
      background: var(--earth); color: white;
      border: none; border-radius: 7px;
      font-size: 14px; font-weight: 600;
      cursor: pointer; margin-top: 4px;
      font-family: var(--font-b); transition: background .2s;
    }
    .search-submit:hover { background: var(--earth-dk); }

    .hero-note {
      font-size: 11px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.38);
      text-align: center; margin-top: 10px;
    }

    /* Stats strip */
    .hero-stats { display: flex; gap: 28px; margin-top: 32px; flex-wrap: wrap; }
    .stat-chip { display: flex; align-items: baseline; gap: 6px; }
    .stat-chip .n {
      font-family: var(--font-d);
      font-size: 28px; color: var(--earth); line-height: 1;
    }
    .stat-chip .l {
      font-size: 11px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);
      font-weight: 500; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.6px;
    }

    /* Right: photo with forest green gradient bleed */
    .hero-right {
      background: url('/images/homepage.jpeg') center/cover no-repeat;
      position: relative;
    }
    .hero-right::after {
      content: '';
      position: absolute; inset: 0;
      background: linear-gradient(to right, var(--forest) 0%, transparent 25%);
    }

    /* ── Features ── */
    .features { background: white; padding: 88px 48px; }
    .features-inner { max-width: 1100px; margin: 0 auto; }

    .section-label {
      font-size: 11px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--leaf);
      text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 1.8px;
      margin-bottom: 10px; text-align: center;
    }
    .features h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-d);
      font-size: 38px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--ink);
      text-align: center; margin-bottom: 6px;
    }
    .features .subtitle { text-align: center; color: var(--quiet); font-size: 16px; margin-bottom: 48px; }

    .features-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 20px; }

    .feature-card {
      border: 1.5px solid var(--border);
      border-radius: 13px; padding: 28px 22px;
      transition: all .2s; background: var(--cream);
    }
    .feature-card:hover {
      border-color: var(--leaf);
      box-shadow: 0 8px 28px rgba(27,67,50,0.1);
      transform: translateY(-3px);
    }
    .feature-icon {
      width: 42px; height: 42px;
      background: var(--mist); border-radius: 10px;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      font-size: 20px; margin-bottom: 14px;
    }
    .feature-card h3 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .feature-card p  { font-size: 14px; color: var(--quiet); line-height: 1.6; }

    /* ── How it works ── */
    .how { background: var(--mist); padding: 80px 48px; }
    .how-inner { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .how h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-d);
      font-size: 36px; font-weight: 400; color: var(--ink);
      text-align: center; margin-bottom: 48px;
    }

    .how-steps {
      display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 32px;
      position: relative;
    }
    .how-steps::before {
      content: '';
      position: absolute; top: 22px;
      left: calc(16.67% + 22px); right: calc(16.67% + 22px);
      height: 1px; background: var(--border); z-index: 0;
    }
    .step { text-align: center; position: relative; z-index: 1; }
    .step-num {
      width: 44px; height: 44px; border-radius: 50%;
      background: var(--forest); color: white;
      font-size: 15px; font-weight: 700;
      display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center;
      margin: 0 auto 16px;
    }
    .step h3 { font-size: 16px; font-weight: 600; color: var(--ink); margin-bottom: 8px; }
    .step p  { font-size: 14px; color: var(--quiet); line-height: 1.6; }

    /* ── CTA band — amber, this is the only place amber dominates ── */
    .cta-band { background: var(--earth); padding: 72px 48px; text-align: center; }
    .cta-band h2 {
      font-family: var(--font-d);
      font-size: 38px; font-weight: 400; color: white; margin-bottom: 12px;
    }
    .cta-band p { font-size: 16px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.8); margin-bottom: 32px; }
    .cta-band a {
      display: inline-block; padding: 15px 44px;
      background: var(--forest); color: white;
      text-decoration: none; border-radius: 9px;
      font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; transition: all .2s;
    }
    .cta-band a:hover { background: var(--moss); transform: translateY(-2px); }

    /* ── Footer ── */
    footer { background: var(--forest); padding: 28px 48px; text-align: center; }
    footer p { color: rgba(255,255,255,0.38); font-size: 13px; }
    footer span { color: var(--earth); }

    /* Responsive */
    @media (max-width: 960px) {
      .hero { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .hero-right { display: none; }
      .hero-left { padding: 120px 28px 80px; }
      .hero-headline { font-size: 44px; }
      .features-grid { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); }
      .how-steps { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 24px; }
      .how-steps::before { display: none; }
    }
    @media (max-width: 640px) {
      .navbar { padding: 0 20px; }
      .navbar-links a:not(.cta) { display: none; }
      .hero-left { padding: 100px 20px 64px; }
      .hero-headline { font-size: 36px; }
      .hs-row { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .features { padding: 64px 20px; }
      .features-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; }
      .how { padding: 60px 20px; }
      .cta-band { padding: 56px 20px; }
      footer { padding: 24px 20px; }
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>

  <nav class="navbar">
    <a href="/home" class="navbar-logo">Keja<span>Hub</span></a>
    <div class="navbar-links">
      <a href="/login">Sign in</a>
      <a href="/register" class="cta">Get started</a>
    </div>
  </nav>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero">
    <div class="hero-left">
      <p class="hero-eyebrow">Student Housing · Kenya</p>
      <h1 class="hero-headline">
        Your next home<br>
        is a <em>key away.</em>
      </h1>
      <p class="hero-sub">
        Browse verified listings near your campus across Nairobi — and send
        a booking request directly to the landlord, all in one place.
      </p>

      <div class="hero-search">
        <h3>Search listings</h3>
        <form action="/student/search" method="GET">
          <div class="hs-row">
            <input type="text" name="keyword" placeholder="Estate or keyword…">
            <select name="location">
              <option value="">Any location</option>
              <% if (typeof locations !== 'undefined') { %>
                <% for (var li = 0; li < locations.length; li++) { %>
                  <option value="<%= locations[li] %>"><%= locations[li] %></option>
                <% } %>
              <% } %>
            </select>
          </div>
          <div class="hs-row">
            <select name="bedrooms">
              <option value="">Any bedrooms</option>
              <option value="1">1 Bedroom</option>
              <option value="2">2 Bedrooms</option>
              <option value="3">3+ Bedrooms</option>
            </select>
            <input type="number" name="max_rent" placeholder="Max rent (KES)" min="0">
          </div>
          <button type="submit" class="search-submit">Search Listings →</button>
        </form>
        <p class="hero-note">Sign in to see full results</p>
      </div>

      <div class="hero-stats">
        <div class="stat-chip"><span class="n">10+</span><span class="l">Listings</span></div>
        <div class="stat-chip"><span class="n">5+</span><span class="l">Landlords</span></div>
        <div class="stat-chip"><span class="n">3+</span><span class="l">Universities</span></div>
        <div class="stat-chip"><span class="n">Free</span><span class="l">to join</span></div>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="hero-right" role="img" aria-label="Student housing in Nairobi, Kenya"></div>
  </section>

  <!-- Features -->
  <section class="features">
    <div class="features-inner">
      <p class="section-label">Why KejaHub</p>
      <h2>Everything a student needs</h2>
      <p class="subtitle">From search to move-in, we have you covered.</p>
      <div class="features-grid">
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🏠</div>
          <h3>Verified Listings</h3>
          <p>Every property is reviewed before going live — no fake listings, no wasted trips.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">📍</div>
          <h3>Near Your Campus</h3>
          <p>Filter by location across Nairobi — Ngong Road, Westlands, Kasarani, Rongai and more.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">💬</div>
          <h3>Direct Bookings</h3>
          <p>Send viewing or booking requests directly to landlords and track their response in real time.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">⭐</div>
          <h3>Student Reviews</h3>
          <p>Read honest reviews from fellow students who have lived in properties you are considering.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">💰</div>
          <h3>Budget-Friendly</h3>
          <p>Listings from KES 8,000/month. Rent range filters help you find options that fit your pocket.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="feature-card">
          <div class="feature-icon">🔒</div>
          <h3>Safe & Monitored</h3>
          <p>Report suspicious listings — our admin team resolves issues within 72 hours.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- How it works -->
  <section class="how">
    <div class="how-inner">
      <h2>Three steps to your next home</h2>
      <div class="how-steps">
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">1</div>
          <h3>Create a free account</h3>
          <p>Sign up as a student or landlord in under two minutes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">2</div>
          <h3>Search and shortlist</h3>
          <p>Browse by location, price, and amenities to find your ideal listing.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="step">
          <div class="step-num">3</div>
          <h3>Book a viewing</h3>
          <p>Send a request to the landlord and get a response — all in-app.</p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- CTA -->
  <section class="cta-band">
    <h2>Ready to find your place?</h2>
    <p>Join students across Nairobi who found their home on KejaHub.</p>
    <a href="/register">Create a free account</a>
  </section>

  <footer>
    <p>© 2025 <span>KejaHub</span> — Student Housing Platform · Built for Kenyan Students</p>
  </footer>

</body>
</html>
